    "Launch zLoader": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Launch zLoader"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "zLoader starten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leave a name empty to disable its hook. Your first shortcut can connect the external tunnel; the second can disconnect it or restore your preferred VPN. Use Set VPN in Shortcuts. zLoader waits for the callback, checks device connectivity, and calls the completion shortcut after the operation finishes. Batch refresh uses one start and completion. Hooks open Shortcuts and require zLoader in the foreground. Do not run a zLoader installation action inside a hook.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leave a name empty to disable its hook. Your first shortcut can connect the external tunnel; the second can disconnect it or restore your preferred VPN. Use Set VPN in Shortcuts. zLoader waits for the callback, checks device connectivity, and calls the completion shortcut after the operation finishes. Batch refresh uses one start and completion. Hooks open Shortcuts and require zLoader in the foreground. Do not run a zLoader installation action inside a hook."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein leerer Name deaktiviert den jeweiligen Hook. Der erste Kurzbefehl kann den externen Tunnel verbinden, der zweite ihn trennen oder dein bevorzugtes VPN wiederherstellen. Verwende „VPN konfigurieren“ in Kurzbefehle. zLoader wartet auf die Rückmeldung, prüft die Geräteverbindung und startet den Abschluss-Kurzbefehl nach Ende des Vorgangs. Ein gemeinsamer Refresh verwendet jeweils einen Start- und Abschluss-Hook. Hooks öffnen Kurzbefehle und benötigen zLoader im Vordergrund. Starte innerhalb eines Hooks keine zLoader-Installation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leave empty to automatically discover SideJITServer on your local network via Bonjour.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leave empty to automatically discover SideJITServer on your local network via Bonjour."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leer lassen, um SideJITServer über Bonjour im lokalen Netzwerk automatisch zu finden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
