    "Shortcut input: JSON with event (before, succeeded, failed, cancelled) and bundleIdentifiers. Without a callback the operation waits until cancelled in zLoader. The completion hook is not guaranteed after process termination or while the device is locked.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shortcut input: JSON with event (before, succeeded, failed, cancelled) and bundleIdentifiers. Without a callback the operation waits until cancelled in zLoader. The completion hook is not guaranteed after process termination or while the device is locked."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kurzbefehl-Eingabe: JSON mit event (before, succeeded, failed, cancelled) und bundleIdentifiers. Ohne Callback wartet der Vorgang, bis er in zLoader abgebrochen wird. Der Abschluss-Hook ist nach Prozessende oder bei gesperrtem Gerät nicht garantiert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
