    "zLoader can only install marketplace apps that have been notarized by Apple.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "zLoader can only install marketplace apps that have been notarized by Apple."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "zLoader kann nur Marketplace-Apps installieren, die von Apple notarisiert wurden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "zLoader can use local network access to discover Bonjour (mDNS) services on your network. This is not required for core functionality.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "zLoader can use local network access to discover Bonjour (mDNS) services on your network. This is not required for core functionality."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "zLoader kann Bonjour-Dienste (mDNS) im lokalen Netzwerk finden. Für die Grundfunktionen ist dies nicht erforderlich."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "zLoader cannot manage the existing certificate without owning its private key. The apps signed with the existing certificate will expire soon unless they are resigned and renewed explicitly by zLoader.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "zLoader cannot manage the existing certificate without owning its private key. The apps signed with the existing certificate will expire soon unless they are resigned and renewed explicitly by zLoader."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "zLoader kann das vorhandene Zertifikat ohne dessen privaten Schlüssel nicht verwalten. Damit signierte Apps laufen bald ab, wenn sie nicht ausdrücklich mit zLoader neu signiert und erneuert werden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "zLoader communicates with on-device services over a local loopback VPN. Enable External Local VPN Tunnel before verifying.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "zLoader communicates with on-device services over a local loopback VPN. Enable External Local VPN Tunnel before verifying."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "zLoader kommuniziert über einen lokalen Loopback-VPN-Tunnel mit Gerätediensten. Aktiviere vor der Prüfung deinen externen lokalen VPN-Tunnel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "zLoader connects its internal tunnel only while pairing, installation or refresh needs it. External tunnel shortcuts are disabled for this connection method.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "zLoader connects its internal tunnel only while pairing, installation or refresh needs it. External tunnel shortcuts are disabled for this connection method."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "zLoader verbindet den internen Tunnel nur, solange Pairing, Installation oder Refresh ihn benötigt. Kurzbefehle für externe Tunnel sind bei dieser Verbindungsmethode deaktiviert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "zLoader does not have detailed information for these entitlements.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "zLoader does not have detailed information for these entitlements."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "zLoader hat keine detaillierten Informationen zu diesen Entitlements."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "zLoader requests the required capabilities and separate provisioning profiles for the app and its extensions from Apple. It then signs and reinstalls itself. Reopen the app afterwards. Your App ID and App Group stay the same. Once setup succeeds, device operations use the integrated tunnel instead of an external VPN.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "zLoader requests the required capabilities and separate provisioning profiles for the app and its extensions from Apple. It then signs and reinstalls itself. Reopen the app afterwards. Your App ID and App Group stay the same. Once setup succeeds, device operations use the integrated tunnel instead of an external VPN."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "zLoader beantragt bei Apple die benötigten Capabilities und separate Provisioning Profiles für App und Erweiterungen. Anschließend signiert und installiert sich die App neu. Öffne sie danach erneut. App-ID und App Group bleiben gleich. Nach erfolgreicher Einrichtung verwenden Gerätedienste den integrierten statt eines externen Tunnels."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "zLoader requires an Apple ID to create development certificates and provisioning profiles for signing apps.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "zLoader requires an Apple ID to create development certificates and provisioning profiles for signing apps."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "zLoader benötigt eine Apple-ID, um Entwicklungszertifikate und Provisioning Profiles zum Signieren zu erstellen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "zLoader setup is complete. You can now install and refresh apps.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "zLoader setup is complete. You can now install and refresh apps."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Einrichtung von zLoader ist abgeschlossen. Du kannst jetzt Apps installieren und aktualisieren."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "zLoader uses location updates to keep background operations active.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "zLoader uses location updates to keep background operations active."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "zLoader verwendet Standortaktualisierungen, um Hintergrundvorgänge aktiv zu halten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "zLoader was installed by a different signing tool (like Xcode or ZLoader).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
